      ],
      "steps_unavailable": "Circumfix built on a pre-predicate adverb. The record is precise (あまり sits before the predicate and the predicate goes negative: verb 〜ない, i-adjective 〜くない, na-adjective/noun 〜じゃない・ではない), but the closed op set has only append and no prepend, so the あまり slot cannot be produced by an ordered build sequence. Steps covering only the negative half would emit 食べない as if it were the pattern."
    },
