      "steps_unavailable": "Lexically restricted derivation. The morphology is simple (i-adjective minus final い + がり) but the record licenses it only for a closed class of emotion/sensation adjectives (寒い・暑い・怖い・寂しい・恥ずかしい) and explicitly names 高い as a base it does NOT accept (*高がり). A variant keyed on base i-adjective would license that ungrammatical output and the base enum has no narrower value, so no steps are emitted."
